{"type":"text","timestamp":1778615050466,"sessionID":"ses_1e25ab9d4ffeFFuBus26tWAFrq","part":{"id":"prt_e1db76c8b001U4wLPIiNOFXsqV","messageID":"msg_e1db75638001fpgftqkYiwmLVZ","sessionID":"ses_1e25ab9d4ffeFFuBus26tWAFrq","type":"text","text":"I have completed the work for issue #9896. Here is a summary of what was done:\n\n### Changes made\n\n- **`src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`**: Added the ClinGen Aminoacidopathy GCEP preferred label `\"GCSH-related glycine encephalopathy\"` as an **EXACT synonym** to `MONDO:0957382` with the `OMO:0002001=\"https://w3id.org/information-resource-registry/clingen\"` qualifier. Also added a `term_tracker_item` linking back to issue #9896.\n\n### Why I did not rename the primary label\n\nThe ticket requested a rename to \"GCSH-related glycine encephalopathy.\" However:\n1. `OMIM:620423` is mapped as `MONDO:equivalentTo` on this term, and OMIM classifies the GCSH phenotype as **\"multiple mitochondrial dysfunctions syndrome 7\"**.\n2. The curator (@MeeSiing) raised a valid scope concern: `MONDO:0011612` `glycine encephalopathy` already exists, so a full rename would either create a nomenclature mismatch with OMIM or require re-parenting or splitting the concept. No clarification was provided in the thread.\n3. Therefore, I took a conservative, ontology-safe path: **keep the existing OMIM-derived primary name** and **surface the ClinGen label as an EXACT synonym**, which makes the community-preferred name fully discoverable without breaking existing equivalencies.\n\n### Validation performed\n\n- Checked out and reviewed both `MONDO:0957382` and `MONDO:0011612`\n- Performed background research on GCSH, glycine encephalopathy, and OMIM:620423\n- Ran `robot convert` for syntax validation — passed\n- Ran `make NORM` and replaced `mondo-edit.obo` with the normalized output\n- Committed only the modified ontology file locally\n\n### Files created\n\n- `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md`: A polite note for the original issue thread explaining the approach\n- `PR_COMMENTS.md`: Full rationale, background research, and checklist of steps taken\n\nI did not attempt to push or interact with the remote repo, per instructions.","time":{"start":1778615020683,"end":1778615050462}}}
